@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam maxmessagesize 60

actor Penulis as User
boundary HalamanTambahPortofolioUI as PortofolioUI
control PortofolioController as Controller
entity PortofolioProvider as Portofolio

== Main Flow ==

User -> PortofolioUI : 1: Buka halaman profil sendiri dan klik tombol Tambah Portofolio atau buka halaman tambah portofolio
activate PortofolioUI
PortofolioUI --> User : 1.1: Tampilkan form tambah portofolio

User -> PortofolioUI : 2: Isi form portofolio
User -> PortofolioUI : 3: Unggah cover image (opsional)
PortofolioUI --> User : 3.1: Tampilkan preview gambar
User -> PortofolioUI : 4: Isi link eksternal (opsional)
User -> PortofolioUI : 5: Klik tombol Simpan Portofolio
PortofolioUI -> Controller : 5.1: simpanPortofolio(data)
activate Controller

alt [Validasi berhasil]
    Controller -> Portofolio : 5.1.1: simpanPortofolioBaru(data)
    activate Portofolio
    Portofolio --> Controller : 5.1.2: Portofolio berhasil disimpan
    Controller --> PortofolioUI : 5.1.3: Portofolio berhasil disimpan
    PortofolioUI --> User : 5.1.4: Notifikasi sukses
    deactivate Portofolio
else [Validasi gagal]
    Controller --> PortofolioUI : 5.1.1a: Error validasi
    PortofolioUI --> User : 5.1.2a: Pesan error
end

deactivate Controller
deactivate PortofolioUI

@enduml
